{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UPLy6TChNWnsRhmZ1T9tsy","type":"tool_result","content":"To estimate the impacts of alcohol on death, we could use the fact that legal drinking age imposes a discontinuity on nature. In the US, those just under 21 years don’t drink (or drink much less) while those just older than 21 do drink. The csv file drinking.csv contains mortality data aggregated by age. Each row is the average age of a group of people and the average mortality by all causes (all), by moving vehicle accident (mva) and by suicide (suicide).\n\nHow much is the effect of alcohol consumption on death of all causes at 21 years? Please only consider data from people that are no older than 22 years and no younger than 20 years. Please answer with the magnitude of change in the number of deaths and round to the nearest hundredth.\ndrinking.csv\nquestion.md","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6c7df496-65e7-47a0-82cf-8ead1b2eec01","uuid":"4a8457e3-afdc-4807-a9a4-5cee8c037968","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:20:10.817Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"To estimate the impacts of alcohol on death, we could use the fact that legal drinking age imposes a discontinuity on nature. In the US, those just under 21 years don’t drink (or drink much less) while those just older than 21 do drink. The csv file drinking.csv contains mortality data aggregated by age. Each row is the average age of a group of people and the average mortality by all causes (all), by moving vehicle accident (mva) and by suicide (suicide).\n\nHow much is the effect of alcohol consumption on death of all causes at 21 years? Please only consider data from people that are no older than 22 years and no younger than 20 years. Please answer with the magnitude of change in the number of deaths and round to the nearest hundredth.\ndrinking.csv\nquestion.md","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"to